1 NOTE Master tree for https://theo-armour.github.io/genealogy.
2 CONT One person for each Wiki biography, plus the people needed to connect them.
2 CONT Facts are taken from the Wiki biographies, which are cited on every person.
2 CONT Where sources disagree, the date the biography prefers is given and a NOTE records the alternatives.
2 CONT Living people are recorded by name only.
2 CONT Each person with a Wiki biography has a REFN of TYPE Wiki naming their Wiki folder.
2 CONT Hand-maintained: edit this file, not the exports in GEDCOM-files/2025.
